{"cover":{"src":"audio/jonah/cover.m4a","text":"Jonah and the Big Fish.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":2.825,"words":[{"w":"Jonah","s":0.675,"e":1.075},{"w":"and","s":1.075,"e":1.188},{"w":"the","s":1.188,"e":1.275},{"w":"Big","s":1.275,"e":1.512},{"w":"Fish","s":1.512,"e":2.225}]},"call-title":{"src":"audio/jonah/call-title.m4a","text":"Part One. Jonah Runs Away.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.35,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"One","s":0.85,"e":1.3},{"w":"Jonah","s":1.438,"e":1.775},{"w":"Runs","s":1.775,"e":2.075},{"w":"Away","s":2.075,"e":2.75}]},"call-0":{"src":"audio/jonah/call-0.m4a","text":"There was once a prophet named Jonah. One day God told him, “Go to the great city of Nineveh, and tell the people to stop doing wrong.”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.9,"words":[{"w":"There","s":0.6,"e":0.713},{"w":"was","s":0.713,"e":0.875},{"w":"once","s":0.875,"e":1.137},{"w":"a","s":1.137,"e":1.238},{"w":"prophet","s":1.238,"e":1.725},{"w":"named","s":1.725,"e":2.013},{"w":"Jonah","s":2.013,"e":2.875},{"w":"One","s":3.138,"e":3.513},{"w":"day","s":3.513,"e":3.812},{"w":"God","s":3.812,"e":4.175},{"w":"told","s":4.175,"e":4.487},{"w":"him","s":4.487,"e":4.975},{"w":"Go","s":5.175,"e":5.35},{"w":"to","s":5.35,"e":5.438},{"w":"the","s":5.438,"e":5.525},{"w":"great","s":5.525,"e":5.888},{"w":"city","s":5.888,"e":6.2},{"w":"of","s":6.2,"e":6.325},{"w":"Nineveh","s":6.325,"e":6.9},{"w":"and","s":7,"e":7.125},{"w":"tell","s":7.125,"e":7.362},{"w":"the","s":7.362,"e":7.45},{"w":"people","s":7.45,"e":7.825},{"w":"to","s":7.825,"e":7.95},{"w":"stop","s":7.95,"e":8.275},{"w":"doing","s":8.275,"e":8.575},{"w":"wrong","s":8.575,"e":9.3}]},"call-1":{"src":"audio/jonah/call-1.m4a","text":"But Jonah didn’t want to go. The people of Nineveh were enemies of his people! So he ran the other way, and got on a ship sailing far across the sea.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":10.475,"words":[{"w":"But","s":0.55,"e":0.7},{"w":"Jonah","s":0.7,"e":1.075},{"w":"didn't","s":1.075,"e":1.3},{"w":"want","s":1.3,"e":1.5},{"w":"to","s":1.5,"e":1.625},{"w":"go","s":1.625,"e":2.25},{"w":"The","s":2.487,"e":2.6},{"w":"people","s":2.6,"e":2.938},{"w":"of","s":2.938,"e":3.062},{"w":"Nineveh","s":3.062,"e":3.5},{"w":"were","s":3.5,"e":3.688},{"w":"enemies","s":3.688,"e":4.162},{"w":"of","s":4.162,"e":4.237},{"w":"his","s":4.237,"e":4.4},{"w":"people","s":4.4,"e":5.15},{"w":"So","s":5.325,"e":5.575},{"w":"he","s":5.575,"e":5.725},{"w":"ran","s":5.725,"e":5.987},{"w":"the","s":5.987,"e":6.125},{"w":"other","s":6.125,"e":6.425},{"w":"way","s":6.425,"e":6.875},{"w":"and","s":6.975,"e":7.1},{"w":"got","s":7.1,"e":7.287},{"w":"on","s":7.287,"e":7.412},{"w":"a","s":7.412,"e":7.537},{"w":"ship","s":7.537,"e":7.925},{"w":"sailing","s":7.925,"e":8.4},{"w":"far","s":8.4,"e":8.725},{"w":"across","s":8.725,"e":9.075},{"w":"the","s":9.075,"e":9.213},{"w":"sea","s":9.213,"e":9.9}]},"storm-title":{"src":"audio/jonah/storm-title.m4a","text":"Part Two. The Great Storm.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.125,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.887},{"w":"Two","s":0.887,"e":1.275},{"w":"The","s":1.4,"e":1.5},{"w":"Great","s":1.5,"e":1.8},{"w":"Storm","s":1.8,"e":2.55}]},"storm-0":{"src":"audio/jonah/storm-0.m4a","text":"But no one can run away from God. He sent a great wind, and a terrible storm crashed over the ship. The sailors were terrified!","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.525,"words":[{"w":"But","s":0.575,"e":0.713},{"w":"no","s":0.713,"e":0.925},{"w":"one","s":0.925,"e":1.1},{"w":"can","s":1.1,"e":1.275},{"w":"run","s":1.275,"e":1.475},{"w":"away","s":1.475,"e":1.775},{"w":"from","s":1.775,"e":1.975},{"w":"God","s":1.975,"e":2.725},{"w":"He","s":2.85,"e":3},{"w":"sent","s":3,"e":3.237},{"w":"a","s":3.237,"e":3.312},{"w":"great","s":3.312,"e":3.688},{"w":"wind","s":3.688,"e":4.3},{"w":"and","s":4.4,"e":4.513},{"w":"a","s":4.513,"e":4.588},{"w":"terrible","s":4.588,"e":5.088},{"w":"storm","s":5.088,"e":5.562},{"w":"crashed","s":5.562,"e":5.963},{"w":"over","s":5.963,"e":6.162},{"w":"the","s":6.162,"e":6.3},{"w":"ship","s":6.3,"e":7.025},{"w":"The","s":7.188,"e":7.35},{"w":"sailors","s":7.35,"e":7.812},{"w":"were","s":7.812,"e":7.95},{"w":"terrified","s":7.95,"e":8.925}]},"storm-1":{"src":"audio/jonah/storm-1.m4a","text":"Jonah was fast asleep down below. “Wake up!” the captain cried. “Pray to your God, so we won’t drown!”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.15,"words":[{"w":"Jonah","s":0.675,"e":0.975},{"w":"was","s":0.975,"e":1.175},{"w":"fast","s":1.175,"e":1.575},{"w":"asleep","s":1.575,"e":1.975},{"w":"down","s":1.975,"e":2.225},{"w":"below","s":2.225,"e":2.95},{"w":"Wake","s":3.2,"e":3.425},{"w":"up","s":3.425,"e":3.925},{"w":"the","s":4.075,"e":4.175},{"w":"captain","s":4.175,"e":4.6},{"w":"cried","s":4.6,"e":5.25},{"w":"Pray","s":5.45,"e":5.675},{"w":"to","s":5.675,"e":5.763},{"w":"your","s":5.763,"e":5.875},{"w":"God","s":5.875,"e":6.25},{"w":"so","s":6.3,"e":6.425},{"w":"we","s":6.425,"e":6.575},{"w":"won't","s":6.575,"e":6.775},{"w":"drown","s":6.775,"e":7.55}]},"storm-2":{"src":"audio/jonah/storm-2.m4a","text":"Jonah told them, “This storm is my fault. I ran away from God. Throw me into the sea, and it will be calm.”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.15,"words":[{"w":"Jonah","s":0.65,"e":0.95},{"w":"told","s":0.95,"e":1.225},{"w":"them","s":1.225,"e":1.55},{"w":"This","s":1.725,"e":1.875},{"w":"storm","s":1.875,"e":2.275},{"w":"is","s":2.275,"e":2.425},{"w":"my","s":2.425,"e":2.65},{"w":"fault","s":2.65,"e":3.35},{"w":"I","s":3.475,"e":3.625},{"w":"ran","s":3.625,"e":3.875},{"w":"away","s":3.875,"e":4.15},{"w":"from","s":4.15,"e":4.35},{"w":"God","s":4.35,"e":4.975},{"w":"Throw","s":5.125,"e":5.425},{"w":"me","s":5.425,"e":5.562},{"w":"into","s":5.562,"e":5.737},{"w":"the","s":5.737,"e":5.875},{"w":"sea","s":5.875,"e":6.25},{"w":"and","s":6.325,"e":6.438},{"w":"it","s":6.438,"e":6.513},{"w":"will","s":6.513,"e":6.612},{"w":"be","s":6.612,"e":6.763},{"w":"calm","s":6.763,"e":7.55}]},"storm-3":{"src":"audio/jonah/storm-3.m4a","text":"So they did. And at once, the wind stopped, and the sea grew still.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":5.075,"words":[{"w":"So","s":0.625,"e":0.738},{"w":"they","s":0.738,"e":0.875},{"w":"did","s":0.875,"e":1.475},{"w":"And","s":1.6,"e":1.738},{"w":"at","s":1.738,"e":1.825},{"w":"once","s":1.825,"e":2.15},{"w":"the","s":2.2,"e":2.325},{"w":"wind","s":2.325,"e":2.612},{"w":"stopped","s":2.612,"e":3.075},{"w":"and","s":3.112,"e":3.212},{"w":"the","s":3.212,"e":3.312},{"w":"sea","s":3.312,"e":3.55},{"w":"grew","s":3.55,"e":3.788},{"w":"still","s":3.788,"e":4.5}]},"fish-title":{"src":"audio/jonah/fish-title.m4a","text":"Part Three. The Big Fish.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.875},{"w":"Three","s":0.875,"e":1.25},{"w":"The","s":1.35,"e":1.45},{"w":"Big","s":1.45,"e":1.688},{"w":"Fish","s":1.688,"e":2.4}]},"fish-0":{"src":"audio/jonah/fish-0.m4a","text":"Down, down Jonah sank into the deep, dark sea — until God sent a huge fish to swallow him up!","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":7.5,"words":[{"w":"Down","s":0.65,"e":1.15},{"w":"down","s":1.25,"e":1.55},{"w":"Jonah","s":1.55,"e":1.925},{"w":"sank","s":1.925,"e":2.237},{"w":"into","s":2.237,"e":2.413},{"w":"the","s":2.413,"e":2.538},{"w":"deep","s":2.538,"e":2.9},{"w":"dark","s":2.975,"e":3.312},{"w":"sea","s":3.312,"e":4.013},{"w":"until","s":4.112,"e":4.375},{"w":"God","s":4.375,"e":4.725},{"w":"sent","s":4.725,"e":4.912},{"w":"a","s":4.912,"e":4.987},{"w":"huge","s":4.987,"e":5.388},{"w":"fish","s":5.388,"e":5.725},{"w":"to","s":5.725,"e":5.862},{"w":"swallow","s":5.862,"e":6.287},{"w":"him","s":6.287,"e":6.412},{"w":"up","s":6.412,"e":6.925}]},"fish-1":{"src":"audio/jonah/fish-1.m4a","text":"For three days and three nights, Jonah sat inside the fish. And there in the dark, he prayed: “I’m sorry, God. Thank You for saving me!”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.7,"words":[{"w"